          "notes": [
            "Root independently read and visually inspected physical PDF page18 (printed page15) of the complete 53-page official international student brochure. The red programme title explicitly says 汉语言本科生招生简章 / Admission Guidelines for Chinese Language Undergraduates. The same page describes training international students and explicitly grants a Bachelor of Arts from Guangxi Normal University. The primary quote ranges are all forced to physical page18, not the table of contents or adjacent programme pages.",
