            "All five current raw GXNU identities, full related current bindings and historical target names/degrees were read. Existing Chinese Language and Culture is non-degree language training. Chinese Language and Literature master/doctorate, Computer Science master and Teaching Chinese to Speakers of Other Languages master differ in qualification or subject. None is the named 汉语言 bachelor; no existing record is normalized or duplicated.",
            "The original official PDF was fully fetched with public DNS, verified TLS and robots handling after the separate source-only size cap was raised from12 to64MiB. The original size-limit failure remains archived. The paid PDF limit remains unchanged and no model request is made. Native Windows tools used a byte-identical short-path copy because the original path exceeds their limit; its hash and actual argv are retained. All original capture and extraction files remain immutable.",
